{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Why Multi-Agent? Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: The Overloaded Single Agent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Here is a single agent trying to do everything. It has one massive system prompt and one context window holding research, code, and reviews:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```typescript"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type AgentResult = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  content: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  tokensUsed: number;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  toolCalls: number;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "};"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "async function singleAgentApproach(task: string): Promise<AgentResult> {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const systemPrompt = `You are a full-stack developer. You must:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "1. Research the requirements"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "2. Write the code"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "3. Review the code for bugs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "4. Write tests"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Do ALL of these in a single conversation.`;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const contextWindow: string[] = [];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  let totalTokens = 0;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  let totalToolCalls = 0;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const research = await fakeLLMCall(systemPrompt, `Research: ${task}`);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  contextWindow.push(research.output);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  totalTokens += research.tokens;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  totalToolCalls += research.calls;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const code = await fakeLLMCall("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    systemPrompt,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    `Given this research:\\n${contextWindow.join(\"\\n\")}\\n\\nNow write code for: ${task}`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  );"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  contextWindow.push(code.output);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  totalTokens += code.tokens;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  totalToolCalls += code.calls;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const review = await fakeLLMCall("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    systemPrompt,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    `Given all previous context:\\n${contextWindow.join(\"\\n\")}\\n\\nReview the code.`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  );"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  contextWindow.push(review.output);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  totalTokens += review.tokens;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  totalToolCalls += review.calls;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  return {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    content: contextWindow.join(\"\\n---\\n\"),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    tokensUsed: totalTokens,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    toolCalls: totalToolCalls,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Problems with this approach:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "- The context window grows with every stage. By the review step, it contains research notes AND code AND prior reasoning."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "- The system prompt is generic. It cannot be tuned for each stage."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "- Nothing runs in parallel."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: Specialist Agents"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Now split it. Each agent gets one job:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```typescript"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type SpecialistAgent = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  name: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  systemPrompt: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  run: (input: string) => Promise<AgentResult>;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "};"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "function createSpecialist(name: string, systemPrompt: string): SpecialistAgent {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  return {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    name,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    systemPrompt,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    run: async (input: string) => {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      const result = await fakeLLMCall(systemPrompt, input);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      return {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        content: result.output,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        tokensUsed: result.tokens,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        toolCalls: result.calls,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    },"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "const researcher = createSpecialist("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  \"researcher\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  \"You are a technical researcher. Read documentation, find patterns, and summarize findings. Output only the facts needed for implementation.\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ");"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "const coder = createSpecialist("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  \"coder\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  \"You are a senior TypeScript developer. Given requirements and research notes, write clean, tested code. Nothing else.\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ");"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "const reviewer = createSpecialist("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  \"reviewer\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  \"You are a code reviewer. Find bugs, security issues, and logic errors. Be specific. Cite line numbers.\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ");"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Each specialist has a focused prompt. Each gets a clean context window with only the input it needs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: Coordinate Through Messages"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Wire the specialists together with explicit message passing:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```typescript"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type AgentMessage = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  from: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  to: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  content: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  timestamp: number;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "};"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "async function multiAgentApproach(task: string): Promise<AgentResult> {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const messages: AgentMessage[] = [];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  let totalTokens = 0;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  let totalToolCalls = 0;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const researchResult = await researcher.run(task);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  messages.push({"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    from: \"researcher\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    to: \"coder\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    content: researchResult.content,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    timestamp: Date.now(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  });"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  totalTokens += researchResult.tokensUsed;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  totalToolCalls += researchResult.toolCalls;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const coderInput = messages"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    .filter((m) => m.to === \"coder\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    .map((m) => `[From ${m.from}]: ${m.content}`)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    .join(\"\\n\");"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const codeResult = await coder.run(coderInput);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  messages.push({"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    from: \"coder\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    to: \"reviewer\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    content: codeResult.content,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    timestamp: Date.now(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  });"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  totalTokens += codeResult.tokensUsed;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  totalToolCalls += codeResult.toolCalls;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const reviewerInput = messages"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    .filter((m) => m.to === \"reviewer\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    .map((m) => `[From ${m.from}]: ${m.content}`)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    .join(\"\\n\");"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const reviewResult = await reviewer.run(reviewerInput);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  messages.push({"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    from: \"reviewer\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    to: \"orchestrator\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    content: reviewResult.content,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    timestamp: Date.now(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  });"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  totalTokens += reviewResult.tokensUsed;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  totalToolCalls += reviewResult.toolCalls;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  return {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    content: messages.map((m) => `[${m.from} -> ${m.to}]: ${m.content}`).join(\"\\n\\n\"),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    tokensUsed: totalTokens,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    toolCalls: totalToolCalls,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Each agent receives only the messages addressed to it. No context pollution. The researcher's 50k tokens of documentation reading never enter the reviewer's context."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 4: Compare"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```typescript"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "async function compare() {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const task = \"Build a rate limiter middleware for an Express.js API\";"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  console.log(\"=== Single Agent ===\");"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const single = await singleAgentApproach(task);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  console.log(`Tokens: ${single.tokensUsed}`);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  console.log(`Tool calls: ${single.toolCalls}`);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  console.log(\"\\n=== Multi-Agent ===\");"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const multi = await multiAgentApproach(task);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  console.log(`Tokens: ${multi.tokensUsed}`);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  console.log(`Tool calls: ${multi.toolCalls}`);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "The multi-agent version uses more total tokens (three agents, three separate LLM calls) but each agent's context stays clean. The quality of each stage improves because the system prompt is specialized."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. Add a fourth specialist: a \"tester\" agent that receives code from the coder and review feedback from the reviewer, then writes tests\n2. Modify the pipeline so the reviewer can send feedback back to the coder for a revision loop (max 2 rounds)\n3. Convert the sequential pipeline into a fan-out: run the researcher and a \"requirements analyzer\" agent in parallel, then merge their outputs before passing to the coder"
      ]
    }
  ],
